"Delivery failed. OpenPGP is selected, but this message was not encrypted "
"with OpenPGP. Switch the chat encryption mode or send unencrypted."
msgstr ""
"Livrarea a eșuat. Este selectat OpenPGP, dar acest mesaj nu a fost criptat "
"cu OpenPGP. Schimbați modul de criptare al conversației sau trimiteți fără "
"criptare."

